   "design": "Fault reports from signal controllers' remote monitoring and from the public form arrive in the work order system with asset ID, location and fault filled, instead of typing them. Standard job templates per asset type fill the usual materials list, and the technician writes the description. Crews and contractors update status in the system, so the separate spreadsheet ends. Inspecting, diagnosing, lookups, checking, issuing, coordinating, inspecting completed work and closing stay with the technician.",
